- [US Open](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/us-open): Tournament hub for the US Open with scores, order of play, and past winners.
- [Indian Wells](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/indian-wells): Tournament hub for the BNP Paribas Open (WTA 1000) with draws, scores, player list, order of play, and past winners.
- [Madrid Open](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/madrid-open): Tournament hub for the Madrid Open (WTA 1000) with draws, scores, player list, order of play, and past winners.

