## Live scores and results

- [Live scores](https://www.wtatennis.com/scores): Real-time scores and match status for all ongoing WTA tournaments. Time-sensitive; reflects matches currently in progress.
- [Tournament scores (example: Australian Open)](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/australian-open/scores): Live and completed match scores for a specific tournament. Each tournament page includes a `/scores` sub-path.
- [Tournament draws (example: Australian Open)](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/australian-open/draws): Current draw brackets for a specific tournament. Each tournament page includes a `/draws` sub-path.
- [Order of play (example: Australian Open)](https://www.wtatennis.com/tournaments/australian-open/order-of-play): Daily schedule and court assignments for a specific tournament. Each tournament page includes an `/order-of-play` sub-path.

